  (label "RF_EMC_N"
    (at 251.46 165.1 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 80b6a559-3b98-5adf-874b-0370b2767022)
  )
  (text "Pin 14 -> 18 + 22: internal TX-LDO output, not an external supply.\nPin 31 -> 26 + 27: internal 1.8 V rail; decouple only.\nVSYS powers VBAT/VBAT2 and VDD_UP; VDD_PAD uses +3V3.\nADR1:0 = 00 => 0x28. WKUP_REQ low; wake over I2C.\nVEN defaults low. DWL_REQ test access via its labelled net.\nANT1/ANT2/VDHF unused: configure normal RF detection.\nY1: NDK CS06346 27.12 MHz, CL 10pF; C26=12pF / C27=15pF.\nC21 at pin 26, C22 at 27; C23 at 18, C24 at 22: 2.2uF each."
    (at 20.32 243.84 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 51b514d7-bca7-5bd7-a140-9e5da6df46ff)
  )
  (text "A1: 40x40 mm, 4T, 0.50/0.30 mm; estimated 1.56 uH. No GND tap.\nC34/C35, C38/C39: paired 0805 C0G tuning pads, DNP.\nC30/C31 + C53/C54: 330 + 33 pF = 363 pF EMC shunt per leg.\nLift R41/R42 and R25/R26 to isolate RF tree for passive VNA tests.\nLift R27/R28 for bare-coil measurement. NEVER power a connected VNA.\nStart TVDD <= 3.3 V; 20 ohm target trades field strength for current margin.\nSee docs/nfc-antenna.md for calculations, layout rules and tuning sequence."
    (at 205.74 239.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 6e601fa0-bd34-53f8-8bd8-669e9ac45e6a)
  )
